LAST TRAY (Flavoria DiningOps Truth)
====================================

This is a simulated educational engagement (Forward Deployed Engineering data foundations assignment). The client scenario
is invented. The data are real and public. This project is not affiliated with, and is not endorsed by, the University of
Turku, the University of Helsinki, Flavoria, Sodexo, or the Finnish Meteorological Institute.

